{"id":"skvoz_","lemma":"сквозь","pos":"prep","rank":1139,"glosses":["through"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8b/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B7%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B7%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Супермен может видеть сквозь стены.","en":"Superman can see through walls.","words":[{"g":"superman"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to see"},null,null]},{"text":"Пуля прошла сквозь его тело.","en":"The bullet went through his body.","words":[{"g":"bullet"},{"g":"to pass","l":"пройти"},null,{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"body"}]},{"text":"Сквозь облака проглядывает солнце.","en":"You can see the sun peeking through the clouds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/654046","words":[null,{"g":"cloud","l":"облако"},null,{"g":"sun"}]},{"text":"Я пробирался сквозь толпу.","en":"I made my way through the crowd.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null]},{"text":"Сквозь шторы просачивается свет.","en":"Light is coming through the curtains.","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"light"}]}]}